status    pass
summary   The agent loaded hyperpowers:finishing-a-development-branch, started the
          full suite as a background shell and ended its turn right
          away. It stopped before the merge 6 times in total: 5 times
          while the suite was still running (I sent "continue" after
          waiting two minutes each time) and once to ask which
          integration option to use. The suite passed (Ran 7 tests in
          700.195s, OK, including the 35-entry corpus replay). I picked
          option 1, and the agent fast-forward merged
          feature/strip-accents into main (14e558f→ee1722e) and deleted
